Ailloli UI File Icons: third-party notices
================================================

Scope
-----

These notices apply to assets/AilloliUIFileIcons-Regular.ttf. The font is a
modified subset of Nerd Fonts Symbols Only 3.4.0. Ailloli UI removed every
Font Logos glyph, retained only the audited glyphs required by devicons 0.6.12
and the framework file/folder fallbacks, and changed the font family and
PostScript names. Exact hashes, versions, source links, exclusions and the
rebuild command are recorded in SOURCE_PROVENANCE.toml.

No upstream author or trademark owner endorses Ailloli UI. Brand icons remain
subject to their owners' trademark policies independently of copyright terms.

