Explicit exclusion
------------------

Nerd Fonts 3.4.0 identifies Font Logos (U+F300-U+F381) as unlicensed in its
license-audit.md. No Font Logos glyph is present in the bundled subset. Calls
requesting those codepoints, or devicons mappings whose Unicode glyph was not
present in the source font, render the generic U+F15B file fallback instead.
